Cyber Risk & GRC Architect Masterclass
======================================

Original author and maintainer:
    Bill Martin (TechTalk with Bill)
    GitHub: https://github.com/BillMartin04
    YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@techtalkwithbill

This is an open-source, open educational resource (OER) curriculum for
enterprise cyber-security governance, risk, and compliance (GRC),
integrated risk management (IRM) on ServiceNow, and AI risk governance.

Repository:
    https://github.com/BillMartin04/irm-cyber-risk-framework

Companion open-source project:
    Lumina Cyber Risk Portal
    https://github.com/BillMartin04/lumina-cyber-risk

Parallel open-source course:
    ServiceNow CSA Course
    https://github.com/BillMartin04/servicenow-csa-course

    ServiceNow Developer Course
    https://github.com/BillMartin04/servicenow-developer-course

